-GAME NAME- AVATAR: BOUNCING HAVENS
-WHAT IT´S ABOUT: AVATAR: BOUNCING HAVENS IS A STORY GAME, IT WILL START WITH A CUTSCENE. AT THE START, YOU LOSE YOUR
POWERS AND THE OBJECTIVE IT TO REGAIN YOUR POWERS (THIS IS THE BOUNCE BACK MESSAGE, THE CHARACTER BOUNCES BACK
BY REGAINING THEIR POWERS AS REDEMPTION. HE CAN ASLO LITERALLY BOUNCE IN GAME) THROUGH MULTIPLE 
CHALLENGES AND A GREAT STORYLINE.
-HOW TO PLAY-
°WASD TO MOVE OR ARROW KEYS
°JUMP: SPACE
°ATTACK: Q
°FIGHT GUARDS
°OVERCOME OBSTICLES
°REACH THE GOAL OF REGAINING YOUR POWERS
°MAKE SURE TO KEEP AN EYE ON THE HEALTH BAR, THE LIVES ARE INFINTE BUT YOU MIGHT LOSE YOUR PROGRESS
°MAKE SURE YOUR VOLUME IS TURNED UP, WE HAVE AMAZING SOUND EFFECTS
-PEOPLE ON THE TEAM-
